{"id":"dificuldade","lemma":"dificuldade","pos":"noun","rank":2237,"glosses":["difficulty (state of being difficult)","a difficult situation; a hardship"],"ipa":"/di.fi.kulˈda.dɨ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"dificuldades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-dificuldade.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom tem dificuldade para fazer amigos.","en":"Tom has trouble making friends.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/280120","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"for / to"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"friendly","l":"amigo"}]},{"text":"Eu tenho dificuldades em francês.","en":"I have difficulty in French.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Não há vida sem dificuldades.","en":"There's no life without hardships.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"state of being alive"},{"g":"-less"},null]},{"text":"Tom teve dificuldade em aprender francês.","en":"Tom had difficulty learning French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/485387","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"to learn"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"Eu tenho dificuldade em lhe entender.","en":"I have difficulty in understanding him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) him / her"},{"g":"to understand"}]}]}